(i) A-02-400;
(ii) UN12473-BR-004 Rev. D;
(iii) UN12473-BR-005 Rev. D;
(iv) MMD-346095-S-DR-00-XX-1000;
(v) Brentford Stadium East Access Bridge, Form F002 (NR/L2/CIV/003/F002: Statement of Design Intent) (April 2015);
(vi) Brentford Football Club Lionel Road Stadium, East Access Bridge, Addendum to Approval in Principle Superstructure, Abutments and Foundations (April 2015). The bridge shall be constructed in accordance with the approved details and completed prior to the first use of the stadium and maintained in accordance with the details hereafter. The bridge shall be open to pedestrians, including members of the public, at all times, unless otherwise agreed in the Stadium Management Plan. Vehicular access shall be restricted to emergency vehicles, authorised stadium employees and visitors, authorised ancillary commercial employees authorised residents and visitors of the Central East residential buildings, and for appropriate servicing only.

